OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening with some sunny spells, though
OL,7,Fthere is a chance of the odd light
OL,8,Fpassing shower. Becoming largely dry
OL,9,Fovernight, especially across eastern
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FMost places dry with bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells, however the odd light
OL,14,Fshower can't be ruled in the morning,
OL,15,For again in the north through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Gentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
