OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FBecoming rather unsettled with the
OL,7,Frisk of rain or showers. The best of
OL,8,Fthe drier and brighter conditions will
OL,9,Fbe across western areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
